          "end": 618,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.10.090:block:3",
          "start": 401
        },
        "quote": "“Sidewalk cafe” means a temporary outdoor service area used for the serving and consumption of food and beverages which are dispensed from inside a restaurant to people seated at tables and chairs in the outdoor area.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.10.090:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
