        "quote": "“Sidewalk fence” means a temporary, nonpermanent fence which is attached to the sidewalk by means of a bracket or other device mounted flush with the pavement. The height of the fence shall not be less than 36 inches nor exceed 42 inches from grade to the highest point. (Ord. 19086 § 1, 5-13-08. Code 1995 § 130-71.)",
